    ☐ Create a dedicated widgets.CycleHotkeyLabel component page.
        ☐ Demonstrate forward and backward cycling.
        ☐ Demonstrate label-right and label-below layouts.
        ☐ Demonstrate option-specific pens using established palette presets.
    ☐ Create a dedicated widgets.ButtonGroup component page.
        ☐ Demonstrate synchronized textual selection and graphical button selection.
        ☐ Compose CycleHotkeyLabel behavior rather than duplicating option logic.
    ☐ Create a dedicated widgets.ToggleHotkeyLabel component page.
        ☐ Demonstrate On, Off, focused, and disabled states.
        ☐ Preserve the official textual toggle semantics.
    ☐ Create a dedicated widgets.ConfigureButton component page.
        ☐ Demonstrate normal, hovered, focused, pressed, and disabled states where supported.
