        ☐ Demonstrate selection synchronized with widgets.Pages.

1.6 Official DFHack slider and specialized widget mockups:
    ☐ Create a dedicated widgets.RangeSlider component page.
        ☐ Demonstrate minimum handle, maximum handle, selected range, and whole-range drag states.
        ☐ Demonstrate multiple stop counts.
    ☐ Create a dedicated widgets.Slider component page.
        ☐ Demonstrate handle position, focus, dragging, and multiple stop counts.
    ☐ Create a dedicated widgets.DimensionsTooltip component page.
        ☐ Demonstrate cursor-following placement.
