Phase 5: Wire interactions and organize the Penpot file
    ☐ Exit with the primary run-to-triage interactions working and every complex specimen located on a clearly named, dark-canvas component page.

5.1 Penpot prototype:
    ☐ Prototype selecting a file or suite in Test Explorer Panel.
    ☐ Prototype selecting a test result in Test Results Panel.
